Hi Megan,

You should try using starting values that are based on the estimates from the simpler model. I wonder if this will work:

pcountOpen(lambdaformula = ~1, gammaformula = ~max.sum, omegaformula = ~1,  pformula = ~1, mixture = "P", K = 100, dynamics = "trend", starts = c(3.66, -0.091, 0, -2.35), se = TRUE)

I wouldn't get your hopes too high, however, because you have a fairly small data set, and your estimate of detection probability is very low.

Richard

